[5.66,"o","── PLAN · nothing below has run ───────────────────────────────────────\r\nThis is what ov does in your DigitalOcean account (region fra1, Spaces in fra1); --debug shows every command:\r\n\r\n  1. Template: render the single node template into .openvidu/digitalocean/tf-do-openvidu-pro-singlenode.tf\r\n     and its variables into .openvidu/digitalocean/openvidu.auto.tfvars.json (0600)\r\n  2. Machines: create the machine, which installs OpenVidu Pro on itself with Terraform (about 1 minute, then OpenVidu installs)\r\n  3. Wait for OpenVidu to be up, read what it published (URL, credentials) and register this directory as the stack\r\n── end of plan ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n\r\n▶ Create the machines on DigitalOcean…\r\n   · initialize Terraform in .openvidu/digitalocean (downloads the provider)\r\n"]
